  "sourceTitle": "Pineapple Pork",
  "sourceText": "Pineapple Pork\nBy: Matt Randall\nPublished: Sunday, April 17, 2011 - 6:06am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 non flavored pork loin\n1/2 cup of brown sugar\n8 ounces can of pineapple chunks\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add pork loin to the crock pot. 2 Cover the pork loin with the brown sugar. 3 Pour pineapple chunks and juice on to to the pork. 4 Set on HIGH for 3-4 hours or until tender.",
